---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About SR Infotech | Pan-India Bulk Inventory Buyers" description="Meet the new SR Infotech: a surplus inventory buying business serving brands and ecommerce companies across India, with its own pickup logistics.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{name:'About us'}]} /><div class="split-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE NEXT CHAPTER OF SR INFOTECH</span><h1>New direction.<br />Same drive to<br />move forward.</h1><p>We see opportunity where stock has stopped moving. The new SR Infotech buys bulk surplus inventory from brands, retailers and ecommerce businesses across India.</p></div><img src="/images/hero.webp" alt="Illustrative connected apparel, kitchenware and electronics inventory" width="1200" height="1200" /></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container intro-layout"><div><span class="eyebrow">A BUSINESS BUILT AROUND YOUR NEXT MOVE</span><h2>Surplus is a situation.<br />Opportunity is a decision.</h2></div><div><p>Changing demand, customer returns and new collections are part of doing business. Keeping that stock indefinitely doesn’t have to be.</p><p>We buy across apparel, home and kitchen, and electronics. With our own logistics for pickup across India, we bring the buying conversation and the movement of goods together.</p><p>Based in Bengaluru. Focused on opportunities across the country.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section insights-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT</span><h2>Direct. Practical.<br />Ready to talk business.</h2></div></div><div class="solution-grid"><div><div class="icon-badge"><Icon name="box" /></div><h3 style="margin-block:22px 14px">A direct buyer</h3><p>Speak to the business considering your stock for purchase. Keep the conversation focused on the lot and its potential.</p></div><div><div class="icon-badge"><Icon name="truck" /></div><h3 style="margin-block:22px 14px">Our own logistics</h3><p>A buying relationship with pickup capability across India. Tell us where your goods are and we’ll discuss the arrangements.</p></div><div><div class="icon-badge"><Icon name="layers" /></div><h3 style="margin-block:22px 14px">A broader view of stock</h3><p>From fresh overstock to untested electronics, we look at the opportunity in each lot and discuss the commercial fit.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><span class="eyebrow">LOOKING FOR THE PREVIOUS BUSINESS?</span><h2>Same name. A new business focus.</h2><p style="margin-top:24px">This domain previously represented a digital marketing and software services business. SR Infotech now focuses on buying surplus and liquidation inventory. Our contact channels remain the same. For a question about an earlier engagement, please <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">contact us directly <Icon size={16} /></a>.</p></div></section>
  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
